The installation has changed from versions earlier than 2.7
copy the files to the following directorys
\APP\PSIGAR29.OPA
\APP\PSIRBF.ALS
\APP\PSITBF.ALS
\APP\PSIWBF.ALS
\APP\PSIGAR\PSICON.RSC
\APP\PSIGAR\PSIWAY.RSC
\OPD\RTEHEAD.RBF
\OPD\TRKHEAD.TBF
\OPD\WAYHEAD.WBF

If you are updating version 2.8 you only need to install the 
psigar29.opa file.

The .ALS files haven't changed so you can keep your originals.



When editing files using any of the .ALS files or the data
application ALWAYS COMPRESS THEM BEFORE SAVING THEM.

